  "releaseNotes": "0.6.0-preview.7: application-layer EF/Mongo repository contracts with compatible provider bridges; layered SQLite, SQL Server, PostgreSQL and MongoDB samples using Arham mediator, patching, OData and notification handlers; stricter patch/query validation and Mongo paging/ID corrections; Kafka subscriber retries and confirmed outbox delivery; repeatable NATS disposal; SQL outbox atomicity and Kafka/NATS outage/recovery examples. See CHANGELOG.md and samples/README.md for upgrade guidance and supported scopes.",
